            {
                "entry_id": "78f6f6b3-cfb5-3b48-9a39-e87b79480e8f",
                "word": "padawan",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c386ffee-c999-4b93-b113-14222de02a4c",
                        "entry_id": "78f6f6b3-cfb5-3b48-9a39-e87b79480e8f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "padawans"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3b45e6f-9457-338a-8781-727597ba81f9",
                        "entry_id": "78f6f6b3-cfb5-3b48-9a39-e87b79480e8f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An apprentice or student Jedi."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4eff543f-edcd-4474-b875-99853e801479",
                                "sense_id": "c3b45e6f-9457-338a-8781-727597ba81f9",
                                "text": "Just as Plato requires a training program that combines physical and mental skills, so does Yoda. The training you'll receive will probably be similar to the training young Luke Skywalker receives from Yoda, since you're probably nearer his age than younger padawans. Throughout his training, Luke questions Yoda about good and evil, the Force, and other concepts important to a Jedi. Likewise, Plato's Republic features a question-and-answer interplay between teacher and students as Socrates's \"padawans\" question him about justice and injustice, the nature of the Good, and the ideal government."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c822974-d495-41a3-b5ed-c62147656a06",
                                "sense_id": "c3b45e6f-9457-338a-8781-727597ba81f9",
                                "text": "Like, practically every day in third grade, Auggie and I would hang out together on FaceChat. We had decided to grow our Padawan braids before I moved away, so it was a great way to check how long they had gotten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "414b1b0b-b4d8-48d7-9e1a-726f5f202a33",
                                "sense_id": "c3b45e6f-9457-338a-8781-727597ba81f9",
                                "text": "Her underlings flanked her, like Padawans studying beneath some great Jedi."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c8b87af-7cf4-351b-a2a9-320d224123c8",
                        "entry_id": "78f6f6b3-cfb5-3b48-9a39-e87b79480e8f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any apprentice or student."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "humorous"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d360a1dc-fab4-4b4e-9064-1f888aa07824",
                                "sense_id": "7c8b87af-7cf4-351b-a2a9-320d224123c8",
                                "text": "It is impossible for you to create this application using only the techniques you learned in the first two chapters, so read on young padawan!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12b7b484-be3b-423c-81e5-a0c928725fc1",
                                "sense_id": "7c8b87af-7cf4-351b-a2a9-320d224123c8",
                                "text": "The root of your problem is just that, young padawan. Hmmm?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f5cc73d-3b37-46ba-9719-9d2a52551f60",
                                "sense_id": "7c8b87af-7cf4-351b-a2a9-320d224123c8",
                                "text": "A long, long time ago in a church far, far away, as a padawan youth pastor, I had a utopian view of what it'd be like to work in youth ministry. When I began my first youth ministry job, I half expected we'd sing \"Kum-Bah-Yah\" when we closed our staff meetings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f35790d-81b2-44fd-ac6d-4028b499f38f",
                                "sense_id": "7c8b87af-7cf4-351b-a2a9-320d224123c8",
                                "text": "The off-season brought quarterback turnover, with Kurt Warner retiring and stalwarts like Donovan McNabb and Jake Delhomme changing teams. These veterans were not replaced by veterans or free agents, but by homegrown understudies, throwbacks to the days when Craig Morton spent four seasons behind Don Meredith in (depending on your point of view) apprenticeship or indentured servitude. The first of the padawan has already flopped. Matt Leinart appears to have once again returned a gift-wrapped starting job in Arizona."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67c36903-fa29-4ce8-ac8f-fa45332f1010",
                        "source_entry_id": "78f6f6b3-cfb5-3b48-9a39-e87b79480e8f",
                        "source_sense_description": "apprentice or student Jedi",
                        "target_lang_word": "padawan",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "padawan",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe7ae15a-8c30-34bd-a44f-a53c2ffb9338",
                                        "entry_id": "93744522-924b-3aa5-b3ee-521769f04075",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apprenti Jedi de l’univers de La Guerre des étoiles, œuvre de George Lucas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Science-fiction",
                                            "univers de Star Wars"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14bbccdb-99cb-4c25-b50c-30b78a075b62",
                                                "sense_id": "fe7ae15a-8c30-34bd-a44f-a53c2ffb9338",
                                                "text": "Cette fois, un groupe de chiens aboie la célèbre Marche Impériale qui accompagne, dans les films de Lucas, les arrivées de celui qui fut jadis le padawan d’Obiwan Kenobi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "632aee56-2b34-3289-8763-a818bde99b1a",
                                        "entry_id": "93744522-924b-3aa5-b3ee-521769f04075",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Apprenti, dans un autre domaine que l’univers original."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03adae72-e61f-4dc7-a1a3-7e68e3357438",
                                                "sense_id": "632aee56-2b34-3289-8763-a818bde99b1a",
                                                "text": "D’ailleurs, si l’échange d’équipement et d’argent est interdit, rien n’empêche le maître d’emmener son padawan dans des contrées lointaines, avec des monstres qui rendent riche et des magasins gavés d’items puissants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17ab7e10-ed95-3a2b-845e-b6ebd34346df",
                                        "entry_id": "93744522-924b-3aa5-b3ee-521769f04075",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne inexpérimentée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Par dérision"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3304a667-17b3-4169-999b-2f5aedcd0d80",
                                                "sense_id": "17ab7e10-ed95-3a2b-845e-b6ebd34346df",
                                                "text": "Prends ça, jeune chef padawan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f8749de-9c1e-40e9-b9c8-2f25bb521431",
                                                "sense_id": "17ab7e10-ed95-3a2b-845e-b6ebd34346df",
                                                "text": "Avis aux « padawans » motivés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "905354ea-6c5f-4a61-a31d-ff15d966d3b1",
